WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.329 --> 00:00:06.270
Bello: Okay.

2
00:00:13.694 --> 00:00:15.476
We made it to the filing cabinet.

3
00:00:15.496 --> 00:00:17.196
Dave: Now what?

4
00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:19.358
Brad: We get the nano-putty out.

5
00:00:19.958 --> 00:00:21.619
It looks like the drawer is open.

6
00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.462
Chuck: But we can't reach the top of the drawer.

7
00:00:26.982 --> 00:00:27.863
It's too high.

8
00:00:27.883 --> 00:00:30.004
Brad: I see that.

9
00:00:31.128 --> 00:00:32.829
Chuck: Well, what do you suggest?

10
00:00:32.849 --> 00:00:37.272
Danny: We need to use─ Dave: ─our imaginations.

11
00:00:37.332 --> 00:00:38.472
Yeah, I know.

12
00:00:39.833 --> 00:00:40.634
Give me a hand.

13
00:00:42.135 --> 00:00:47.978
Dave: If we all lift this up, Brad will be able to climb up into the drawer.

14
00:00:48.498 --> 00:00:50.379
Bello: That's a great idea.

15
00:00:50.399 --> 00:00:54.502
Brad: Okay, everybody lift together.

16
00:01:01.996 --> 00:01:02.877
Tina: That was tough!

17
00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:07.601
Okay, Brad.

18
00:01:08.141 --> 00:01:08.722
Up you go.

19
00:01:08.742 --> 00:01:13.545
Danny: Brad, let me do this.

20
00:01:13.565 --> 00:01:17.529
Danny: I caused all this trouble, I want to help make things right.

21
00:01:17.549 --> 00:01:18.629
Brad: Sure.

22
00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.031
Do you remember what the nano-putty looks like?

23
00:01:21.051 --> 00:01:23.153
Danny: I can't forget.

24
00:01:23.173 --> 00:01:31.420
Danny: Two centimeters, three centimeters [n3@five centimeters, six centimeters.

25
00:01:32.108 --> 00:01:34.289
Danny: Boy, this is a long ruler.

26
00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:37.991
Fifteen centimeters, sixteen centimeters.

27
00:01:38.011 --> 00:01:39.832
Bello: Keep going, Danny.

28
00:01:40.313 --> 00:01:41.013
You can make it.

29
00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:47.437
Danny: Twenty-six, twenty-seven thirty centimeters.

30
00:01:47.457 --> 00:01:49.838
Danny: I made it!

31
00:01:50.598 --> 00:01:51.419
Wish me luck!

32
00:01:52.900 --> 00:01:53.280
All: Good luck!

33
00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:57.542
Mrs. Rice: Hello?

34
00:01:58.423 --> 00:02:02.097
Hello? Is anybody home?

35
00:02:02.117 --> 00:02:06.158
Mrs. Rice: I guess nobody is home.

36
00:02:06.919 --> 00:02:08.559
I should leave a note to warn them.

37
00:02:08.579 --> 00:02:11.321
Mrs. Rice: Now, where is my pen?

38
00:02:13.462 --> 00:02:14.442
What should I write?

39
00:02:14.462 --> 00:02:17.984
Mrs. Rice: "Be very careful.

40
00:02:18.804 --> 00:02:21.505
A dangerous giant might be nearby."

41
00:02:21.525 --> 00:02:23.086
Mrs. Rice: No, no.

42
00:02:24.026 --> 00:02:27.468
"A dangerous, invisible giant might be nearby."

43
00:02:37.164 --> 00:02:37.924
Danny: There it is.

44
00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:40.706
I just need to grab a small piece.

45
00:02:41.646 --> 00:02:44.948
Danny: Boy, this is tough stuff.

46
00:02:45.708 --> 00:02:47.669
I didn't realize it was so sticky.

47
00:02:51.931 --> 00:02:54.732
Ugh, this stuff smells when it's up close.

48
00:02:56.693 --> 00:03:00.655
Danny: Now I'm all covered with this stuff!

49
00:03:00.955 --> 00:03:07.062
Gross. Danny: Well, at least I got what I came for.

50
00:03:07.682 --> 00:03:15.828
Danny: Now it's time to get out of here.

51
00:03:15.848 --> 00:03:19.131
Danny: How am I going to climb all the way up there?

52
00:03:19.151 --> 00:03:23.153
Danny: There must be something in this drawer that I can use.

53
00:03:23.174 --> 00:03:28.938
Danny: Ugh, this stuff just sticks to everything.

54
00:03:28.958 --> 00:03:31.880
Danny: It's almost as sticky as chewing gum.

55
00:03:34.604 --> 00:03:35.985
Danny: Hey, wait a minute!

56
00:03:36.605 --> 00:03:38.606
It is as sticky as chewing gum!

57
00:03:38.626 --> 00:03:40.707
Danny: That gives me an idea.

58
00:03:41.808 --> 00:03:43.169
Now, let's hope this works.

59
00:03:43.209 --> 00:03:46.931
Danny: Just as I thought, it sticks.

60
00:03:48.051 --> 00:03:50.653
Brad's not the only one with clever ideas.

61
00:03:50.673 --> 00:03:53.414
Danny: I'm getting good at this kind of climbing.

62
00:03:54.275 --> 00:03:56.496
Danny: I did it!

63
00:03:56.516 --> 00:03:59.718
Tina: Did you get it?

64
00:03:59.738 --> 00:04:01.619
Danny: I sure did.

65
00:04:02.379 --> 00:04:03.420
I'm coming down now.

66
00:04:05.144 --> 00:04:07.425
Dave: You've got it stuck all over your clothes.

67
00:04:08.005 --> 00:04:08.765
Bello: What happened?

68
00:04:08.785 --> 00:04:14.167
Danny: Yeah, I got it stuck all over me.

69
00:04:14.207 --> 00:04:17.267
Danny: It's a lot messier when you're this small.

70
00:04:17.287 --> 00:04:18.388
Brad: Great.

71
00:04:18.548 --> 00:04:21.429
We don't need a lot because the shrink-gun is so small now.

72
00:04:22.229 --> 00:04:22.689
Bello: Okay.

73
00:04:23.249 --> 00:04:32.912
Now that we have the nano-putty─ Chuck: It's a giant mouse!

74
00:04:33.986 --> 00:04:35.745
Tina: It's coming straight for us!
